  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/abb4563a-c619-42f1-ba79-d6cacc1c892a-05545eb3-cdc3-4eae-b4e0-1ca692972787-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo></math>&nbsp;the graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/86b84935-fd96-4bf4-a1b6-0ce1cea41692-d161592b-65a8-4598-8eb8-63d94282451b-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 240px;\" /></p><p>So graph of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/05545eb3-cdc3-4eae-b4e0-1ca692972787-image.png\" style=\"width: 305px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is differentiable everywhere in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
